      "message": "This covers the Hard Reset case. I\u0027m not sure what the exact best time to notify is, but I don\u0027t think it matters that much, and this seemed like the simplest thing to do.\n\nThe case I had hoped to cover generally was, \"PD communication was interrupted, so whatever you had stored is stale.\" I think that would also include detaches and intervals where PD is disabled, but I couldn\u0027t immediately find a single code location that covered all of those cases.",
